            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "caliboo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My husband thought the flavor of the jerky was very good, but thought it was too crunchy. I'll try it again and reduce the cooking time to give it the chewier texture that he likes.",
            "datePublished": "2002-05-07T14:43:52.730Z"
          },
          {
